# Arathi Highlands (Horde) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde side of contested Arathi: Hammerfall hub, the Witherbark and
# Boulderfist campaigns, the Stromgarde sigil chain and its Trol'kalar
# finale, the Myzrael twin, plus profession and writ specials and three
# expedition turn-ins (Wetlands, Dustwallow, Riverglades). Every accept is
# on key 1417; shared links live in the main guide and are NOT duplicated
# here (main guide ungated this round so both factions see them).
# See docs/arathi-horde-census.md for the census (29 IN, band 30-40).
guide butler-routes-completionist/arathi-horde
title Arathi Highlands (Horde)
levels 30-40
zone Arathi Highlands
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Hammerfall - mustering the campaign

  note Hammerfall holds the Horde hub: Tor'gan, Gor'mul, Drum Fel, Korin Fel, Doctor Gregory Victor and Zaruk. Take the hub's asks here; the Highlands fill them.
  accept 655 -- Hammerfall - Gor'mul @72.64,33.93; carry the word to Tor'gan
  turnin 655 -- Hammerfall - the word to Tor'gan @74.72,36.29
  accept 671 -- Foul Magics - Tor'gan @74.72,36.29; Bloodstone Amulets off the northern Syndicate
  note 638 Trollbane accepts in Stranglethorn (contracted in stranglethorn-horde) - this chain reads whole across the two guides.
  accept 639 -- Sigil of Strom - Zengu @73.8,33.96; the Sigil rides the Stromgarde run below
  note 676 The Hammer May Fall accepts in Alterac, outside any contract - Drum Fel still takes the campaign from here.
  accept 677 -- Call to Arms - Drum Fel @74.24,33.92; Witherbark axes, east
  note 652 is the shared Myzrael chain in the main guide - the Keystone take below needs it done.
  accept 97539 -- Silky Sutures - Doctor Gregory Victor @73.41,36.89; Surgical Spidersilk off the plains creepers
  accept 95663 -- Dragonmaw Rumors - Zaruk @74.54,35.64; carry the word to the Wetlands leg below
  accept 95143 -- Finding Tan'jani - Tor'gan @74.72,36.29; Tan'jani waits in the Riverglades leg below
  accept 92707 -- The Giant in the Den - no placed giver in the data; Goliath's Wristguards come off Witherbark Goliath in the east, hand them to Drum Fel
  accept 94212 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Elixir of Wisdom - Muggol Breezebeard @48.68,55.78; have the writ and an Elixir of Wisdom in your bags
  turnin 94212 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Elixir of Wisdom - the writ and the Elixir to Muggol Breezebeard

step Hammerfall - Brumn's hides (Leatherworking)

  when skill Leatherworking 1
  accept 5146 optional -- Elemental Leatherworking - Brumn Winterhoof @28.27,45.09; Hearts of Fire, Globes of Water, Cores of Earth and Breaths of Wind, west
  note Brumn's four elements have no placed farm in Arathi in the data (only Rumbling Exile shows here) - bring them from anywhere.
  turnin 5146 optional -- Elemental Leatherworking - the elements to Brumn Winterhoof

step Hammerfall - Victor's triage (First Aid)

  when skill First Aid 1
  note 6623 Trauma accepts in Durotar and is contracted nowhere - Victor still takes the triage from here.
  accept 6622 optional -- Triage - Doctor Gregory Victor @73.41,36.89; patients wait in the Dustwallow leg below

